Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.25,0:03:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what'd you find?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.97,0:03:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's five of us left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.03,0:03:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, me, Yamikaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.31,0:03:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see Death Gun, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.57,0:03:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's another player\Nout there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.07,0:03:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The scan didn't pick them up, so they\Nmight be hiding in a cave like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.37,0:03:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just us five?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.29,0:03:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's been an hour\Nand 45 minutes already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.29,0:03:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing as how the last BLB ended in about\Ntwo hours, this one's right on schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.01,0:03:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised no one's\Nchucked a grenade in here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.11,0:03:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe we've got Death\NGun to thank for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.61,0:03:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could be while he's looking for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's whittling down the\Ncompetition with that rifle of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.25,0:03:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're right, then he's a\NShino for the Max Kills Award
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should worry about Yamikaze\NYou were probably the only
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.69,0:03:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one who showed up on his\Nterminal So we better get ready,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.85,0:04:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cause he'll be coming for ya
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.79,0:04:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He any good?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.13,0:04:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was runner-up in the last B.O.B.\NHe's your typical full-on E.G.I.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.87,0:04:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,type They call him the\Nrun-gun demon or something
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.29,0:04:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.45,0:04:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run and gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You run, shoot, run.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.21,0:04:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a style of combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His main weapon's a Calico M900A,\Nan ultralight submachine gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.21,0:04:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yamikaze couldn't compete with Zexeed's\Nrare gun and armor in the last tourney.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.41,0:04:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even though he didn't win, some\Npeople say he's the better player.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.45,0:04:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's really that good?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.81,0:04:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like the best player on\NJapan's GGO server? Good?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.93,0:04:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.83,0:04:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andy might be our ace in the hole, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.41,0:04:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're right about Death Gun, then\NI'm the only one he's ready to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.05,0:04:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, cause his partner's waiting\Nback at my apartment right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.03,0:04:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, I figure that if that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.47,0:04:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yamakaze's not in any real\Ndanger of getting killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.59,0:05:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is gonna sound cold, but I was thinking\Nhe would make the perfect decoy for us.
