Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.05,0:05:10.64,Android,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\fscx42\fscy42\c&HFFFFEF&\pos(1177.65,828.2)}Yamikaze
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.53,0:05:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a way, we got two decoys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.03,0:05:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Him in here, and me IRL.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.77,0:05:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're pretty brave, Sinon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.17,0:05:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.55,0:05:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying not to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.57,0:05:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to avoid what scares\Nme, like I always do!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.85,0:05:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you think it'll work?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.23,0:05:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah I mean, it sounds pretty good
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.45,0:05:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, there's still\None thing that bothers me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.01,0:05:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just now, when I added up the players\Nwho were left and who were done,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.55,0:05:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could only come up with 28.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.29,0:05:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,PaleRider's 29, but still,\Nwe're short one. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.43,0:05:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could Death Gun have killed\Nsomeone else after he tried for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.49,0:05:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.15,0:05:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, his number two's supposed\Nto be waiting at my place now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.69,0:05:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, that's how I figured it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.45,0:06:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, I'm thinking\Nsomething else is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.19,0:06:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Between the time Death Gun shot\NPaleRider and when he tried for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.35,0:06:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only 30 minutes had gone by.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.87,0:06:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So based on my theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.99,0:06:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pale rider's apartment would have to be no
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.73,0:06:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more than 30 minutes away from your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.35,0:06:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of convenient, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.85,0:06:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess, but what other\Nexplanation is there for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Death Gun isn't working\Nwith just the one guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.01,0:06:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like maybe he's got a few more partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he does,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.73,0:06:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it'd be possible\Nto kill one player while
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.21,0:06:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,still having someone\Navailable to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.41,0:06:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.81,0:06:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For Yamikaze he could be a target\Nnow too i don't know i don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.31,0:06:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god if you're\Nright and there's more of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.79,0:06:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them out there how many\Nmore are we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.15,0:06:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're all x laughing\Ncoffin at least 10
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.75,0:07:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe more i doubt they're\Nall involved with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.47,0:07:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we can't be sure there's only one real
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.95,0:07:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world killer out there\Nanymore they're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.81,0:07:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why else would they do this\Nafter getting out of SAO alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.15,0:07:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could anyone stay a\Nplayer killer after that game?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.31,0:07:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the same reason as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.13,0:07:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I keep being a\Nswordsman and you a sniper?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.11,0:07:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I called them PKers, but I take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.63,0:07:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are lots of people\Nwho PK in this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.75,0:07:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to run with a\Nsquad of PKers myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.39,0:07:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at the end of the day, PKers\Nhave a code of honor they stick to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.65,0:07:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not PKers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.13,0:07:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They kill people with poison\Nwhile they're unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.89,0:07:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a bunch of cowards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.81,0:07:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no honor in murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.87,0:07:48.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's chicken shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.07,0:07:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straight up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.17,0:07:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we can't let them get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.65,0:07:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.81,0:07:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got a chance to stop these\Npeople and we're gonna take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.55,0:08:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death Gun's going down\Non this battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.93,0:08:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over for him and his pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.97,0:08:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make them all pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.07,0:08:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is how I make\Namends for what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.53,0:08:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For losing it in the chaos of battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.51,0:08:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For killing those two players that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.49,0:08:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the other one later on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.69,0:08:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is how I'll get closure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.97,0:08:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll protect Xenon, take out\NYamikaze, and end Death Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.57,0:08:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be easy, but\Nit's what I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.27,0:08:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take Yamikaze out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.11,0:08:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let Death Gun kill him. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.81,0:08:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yamakaze's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt even you could\Nfinish him with one hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.73,0:08:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if he's busy with you,\NDeath Gun's sure to go for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then how are we going to deal with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you forget what I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.51,0:08:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a sniper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.27,0:08:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have eyes on you the whole time,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.25,0:08:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so once they move on you,\NI'll know their locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.27,0:08:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll hit Yamikaze first,\Nthen I'll go for Death Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.27,0:09:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.51,0:09:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We go with your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.95,0:09:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I think they should\Nbe pretty close by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.25,0:09:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna hop on the buggy and head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.81,0:09:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave the cave right after I do,\Nand get set up as fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.61,0:09:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck out there, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.81,0:09:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yamikaze is coming from the west,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.73,0:10:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so if a shot comes from the east,\Nit'll probably be Death Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.45,0:10:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got that cloak, so when\Nhe shoots, he'll be invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.21,0:10:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he hits Kirito in the\Nharder head, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.31,0:10:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you can cut my bullet in\Nhalf, you can dodge his, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.01,0:10:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.49,0:10:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My first priority is taking\NYamikaze out of the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.39,0:10:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I miss, Kirito will get shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.03,0:10:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then Death Gun will find me and kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.87,0:10:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My life, my real life, depends on a\Nsingle bullet, like it did that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.11,0:10:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.47,0:10:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm weak, and I need your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.51,0:10:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The strength to stand up\Nfor myself and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.77,0:11:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Southwest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Yamikaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.45,0:11:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Xenon's got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.51,0:11:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.49,0:11:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could try to shoot in front of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.49,0:11:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or shoot at his feet, hope he\Npanics, and then take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.11,0:11:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.02,0:11:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once he's got Kirito in range,\Nhe'll stop to steady his aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.11,0:11:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to wait till he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.75,0:11:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.75,0:11:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.03,0:11:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.65,0:12:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Concentrate, Ho Min on his\Ndrive to kill, like last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.49,0:12:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right. I could feel\Ntheir lust for murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.31,0:12:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how I noticed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.55,0:12:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first guy who attacked me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.91,0:12:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.33,0:12:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.93,0:12:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday, I'll kill you properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday, I'll kill you properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.71,0:13:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yamikaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.55,0:13:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.61,0:14:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.35,0:14:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.33,0:14:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.59,0:14:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's up to you now, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.17,0:15:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.41,0:15:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.95,0:15:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
