Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.69,0:15:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how strong his\Nenemy is, Daddy won't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.55,0:15:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's Daddy, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn left!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.71,0:15:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His room is eight meters down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.67,0:15:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirigaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.95,0:15:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.97,0:15:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Natsuki, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.25,0:15:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.91,0:16:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong with\NKi - I mean, Kazuto?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.73,0:16:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.29,0:16:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it looks bad,\Nbut he's not in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.85,0:16:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His heart rate spiked is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.25,0:16:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His heart rate?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.03,0:16:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.94,0:16:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.91,0:16:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy, look to your right\Nat the monitor on the wall.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.47,0:16:18.97,Android,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\fscx38\fscy38\c&H3D4042&\pos(613.5,978)\iclip(m 586.5 1006.5 l 712.5 900 717 994.5)}Visitor
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.95,0:16:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to patch in the live\Nfootage from the MMO stream.
