Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.79,0:16:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that...Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.63,0:16:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Kirigaya's avatar from the game\Nhe's diving in now? Uh-huh. He's in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.47,0:16:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that's why his\Nheart's racing so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.17,0:16:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An Aincrad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.33,0:16:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.45,0:16:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of Laughing Coffin's leaders was a
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.45,0:16:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,master with an estoc.\NBut what was he called?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.51,0:17:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sterben?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.63,0:17:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it supposed to be Steven?\NIt's not. But he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.27,0:17:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a German word.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.85,0:17:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.99,0:17:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a medical term we use.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.93,0:17:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pronounced.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.15,0:17:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sterben.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.15,0:17:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sterben?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.71,0:17:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means to die In hospitals, we used\Nthat word when a patient's passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.25,0:17:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.01,0:17:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an interesting\Nweapon you got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.51,0:17:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'd known there were metal swords in\NGGO, I would have gotten my hands on one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.95,0:17:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have done your\Nhomework before logging in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.05,0:17:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black Swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.23,0:17:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made this with the\NWeapon Creation skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.25,0:17:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be any longer or\Nheavier, but it does the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.39,0:17:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, if that's the best sword I can make,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.61,0:18:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I guess I couldn't\Nmake one I'd be happy with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.09,0:18:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still into swords with\Nhigh strength requirements?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.51,0:18:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.41,0:18:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be pretty tough for you, having\Nto twirl that flashlight around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.11,0:18:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing's not as bad as all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.81,0:18:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always wondered what it'd be\Nlike to fight with one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.51,0:18:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, a sword's a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.97,0:18:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can slash you and burn through your\NHP with it, it's good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.23,0:18:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You talk a good game, but it's all talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.97,0:18:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sucked in too much rotten\Nair from the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.13,0:18:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That half-assed Vorpal\Nstrike you just pulled?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.05,0:18:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the old you saw it,\Nhe'd shake his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.53,0:18:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.71,0:18:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the same goes for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.83,0:18:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're living in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.31,0:18:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you think you're still\Na member of Laughing Coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.33,0:18:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.13,0:18:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.31,0:19:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I guess you understand the\Ndifference between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.41,0:19:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a genuine red player,\Nwhile you are not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.91,0:19:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed only because you were scared,\Nscared and desperate to survive but
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.51,0:19:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,instead of facing it I bet you tried to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.73,0:19:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forget it even happened\Njust like a coward I
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.25,0:19:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might be a coward, but\Nstill I'll stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.69,0:19:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from killing again I figured out how sexy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.47,0:19:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than the others were murdered it's got\Nnothing to do with that handgun of yours and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.47,0:19:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you don't have special powers either\Nhow'd those people die then back at the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.83,0:19:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,terminals at the governor's office you use
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.45,0:19:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that cloak to scope out\Nthe addresses of the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.63,0:19:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bob contestants then you had someone break\Ninto their apartments and timed it so
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.05,0:19:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when you fired they'd inject a drug into\Nthem making it look like they died of heart
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.69,0:20:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.60,0:20:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.71,0:20:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Ministry of Internal Affairs\Nhas the in-game and real-world
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.21,0:20:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,info of every single player from SAO.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.77,0:20:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once they get your handle,\Nthey'll find out your real name,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.17,0:20:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your real address, and all the\Nevil shit you've ever done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.03,0:20:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.97,0:20:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all over for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.89,0:20:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So log out and turn yourself in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.41,0:20:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you've got it all figured
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.23,0:20:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.14,0:20:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you can't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.85,0:20:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I know you'll never remember
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.41,0:20:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what my handle was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.91,0:20:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.49,0:20:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you so sure I won't?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.39,0:20:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't even remember the reason
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.91,0:20:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you forgot it in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.95,0:20:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.86,0:20:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that battle between\Nyour group and mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.27,0:20:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried to tell you my name, but you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.95,0:21:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point in giving me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.39,0:21:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.95,0:21:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as I'm concerned,\NI'll never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.71,0:21:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't remember my\Nhandle, and you never will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.11,0:21:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never gave it to you, and\Nnow I'm going to cut you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.59,0:21:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave you lying\Nhere watching helplessly
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.97,0:21:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as I kill the girl and you can't stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.71,0:21:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stings, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.35,0:21:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is made from the best\Nmetal you can get in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.55,0:21:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's armor plating from\Na space battleship.
